Z||000001||Old Lar||11-15-2001||09:36 AM||||The last price list I had (1999)for a new crate 3.4 engine...new everything, injectors, starter, waterpump..everything was around $4k. Transmission affected cost a couple of hundred more, but I can't remember which was more. I have no idea what the engine in my 88 was alone, cause I had lots more done to the car while it was out there, plus he did alot of stuff on my 87 too.<P>Its unusual that Bob doesn't answer the phone, he's at the shop usually from 0600-2000 just about every day.  217-379-9140||||reg||1
